# Gasworks site — Cursor rules

## Project
Static marketing site in this folder. Stack: HTML, CSS, JS. Deploy: Vercel (`gasworks-site.vercel.app`). Remote: `https://github.com/WileyWorx/gasworks-site.git`.

## Git
After completing any task that changes this site, commit and push to `main` without asking:
- Stage only files changed for that task under `gasworks-site/`.
- Use concise commit messages focused on why.
- Push to `origin main` after each commit.

Revoke only when the user explicitly says to stop auto commit/push.

## Conventions
- Brand fonts: Space Grotesk (display), DM Sans (body).
- Do not re-add the footer slogan "Built different. Built to last."
- Capability lanes: Spotlights, Narratives, Solutions → link to `portfolio.html?cat=…`
